1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,437
Why should a salt make water acidic or basic at all?

2
00:00:03,437 --> 00:00:11,718
Because of hydrolysis: the reaction of a salt's cation or anion with water to give back the parent acid or base.

3
00:00:11,718 --> 00:00:14,804
It is neutralisation running in reverse.

